This system provides a complete workflow for managing restaurant menus, from chef submissions to manager approvals to customer viewing, with category-based organization for better user experience.

# User Group File Management System

Below is a comprehensive implementation of a user group file management system using Python with Flask for the web interface and SQLite for database storage. This system allows users to be assigned to different groups, each with its own file storage area, and administrators can adjust user groupings.

