8. Download button to save the watermarked audio

Note: The actual audio processing is simulated in this implementation since true audio watermarking requires complex audio processing techniques. In a real-world application, you would need to use a proper audio processing library or server-side processing to implement true watermarking.

# Audio Segmentation Labeling Tool

Below is a complete implementation of an audio segmentation labeling tool using Python with Flask for the web interface, Pydub for audio processing, and JavaScript for the frontend. This tool allows users to upload audio files, add labels to time segments, and export the labeled segments as a JSON file.

