This code implements a front-end tool for adding echo effects to audio with the following features:

1. Users can upload an audio file using the file input
2. Users can adjust echo intensity (0-100%) and delay time (0-2000ms) using sliders
3. When users click "Process Audio", the audio is processed with the echo effect
4. The processed audio can be previewed using the audio player
5. Users can save the echoed audio using the download button

The code uses the Web Audio API to process the audio in the browser. Note that for actual echo processing, more sophisticated algorithms would be needed, but this implementation provides a basic echo effect by duplicating the audio signal with a delay and reduced volume.

The code is fully executable and includes all necessary styling and functionality for the described requirements.

