# Web-Based Music Synthesizer with Drag-and-Drop Module Connections

I'll create a comprehensive web-based synthesizer with drag-and-drop functionality, real-time playback, and audio export capabilities. This implementation uses HTML, CSS, JavaScript (with Web Audio API), and a modular design.

