<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Drone Management System</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1, h2 {
            color: #333;
        }
        .login-form, .admin-form {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .login-form h2, .admin-form h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        input[type="text"], input[type="password"], button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 5px 0;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        button {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
        .drone-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .drone-card {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .drone-status {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .drone-controls {
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .control-btn {
            background-color: #2ecc71;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            margin: 5px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .control-btn:hover {
            background-color: #27ae60;
        }
        .admin-section {
            display: none;
        }
        .admin-section.show {
            display: block;
        }
        .admin-form .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .admin-form label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .admin-form input[type="text"], .admin-form input[type="number"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .admin-form button {
            background-color: #e74c3c;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .admin-form button:hover {
            background-color: #c0392b;
        }
        .auth-message {
            color: red;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .user-role {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Drone Management System</h1>

        <!-- Login Form -->
        <div class="login-form">
            <h2>Login</h2>
            <div class="auth-message" id="authMessage"></div>
            <form id="loginForm">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="username">Username:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit">Login</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <!-- Drone Status Display -->
        <div id="droneStatusContainer" style="display: none;">
            <h2>Drone Status</h2>
            <div class="drone-list" id="droneList">
                <!-- Drone cards will be inserted here -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Admin Section -->
        <div class="admin-section" id="adminSection">
            <h2>Admin Panel</h2>
            <div class="admin-form">
                <h3>Add New Drone</h3>
                <form id="adminForm">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="droneId">Drone ID:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="droneId" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="droneName">Drone Name:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="droneName" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="droneModel">Model:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="droneModel" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="droneStatus">Initial Status:</label>
                        <select id="droneStatus">
                            <option value="in-flight">In-Flight</option>
                            <option value="landing">Landing</option>
                            <option value="malfunction">Malfunction</option>
                            <option value="idle">Idle</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit">Add Drone</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Logout Button -->
        <div id="logoutSection" style="display: none;">
            <button id="logoutBtn">Logout</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Simulated drone data
        let drones = [
            { id: 1, name: "Drone X1", model: "X1 Pro", status: "in-flight", lastUpdate: new Date().toISOString() },
            { id: 2, name: "Drone Y2", model: "Y2 Standard", status: "landing", lastUpdate: new Date().toISOString() },
            { id: 3, name: "Drone Z3", model: "Z3 Advanced", status: "malfunction", lastUpdate: new Date().toISOString() }
        ];

        // User session
        let currentUser = null;
        let isAdmin = false;

        // DOM elements
        const loginForm = document.getElementById('loginForm');
        const droneStatusContainer = document.getElementById('droneStatusContainer');
        const adminSection = document.getElementById('adminSection');
        const logoutSection = document.getElementById('logoutSection');
        const authMessage = document.getElementById('authMessage');
        const adminForm = document.getElementById('adminForm');
        const droneList = document.getElementById('droneList');

        // Event listeners
        loginForm.addEventListener('submit', handleLogin);
        adminForm.addEventListener('submit', handleAdminFormSubmit);
        logoutSection.addEventListener('click', handleLogout);

        // Initialize the page
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            // Initially show login form
            droneStatusContainer.style.display = 'none';
            adminSection.style.display = 'none';
            logoutSection.style.display = 'none';
        });

        // Handle login
        function handleLogin(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const username = document.getElementById('username').value;
            const password = document.getElementById('password').value;

            // Check if admin credentials
            if (username === 'uavadmin' && password === '321321') {
                currentUser = { username: 'uavadmin', role: 'admin' };
                isAdmin = true;
                authMessage.textContent = 'Admin login successful!';
                authMessage.style.color = 'green';
                showAdminSection();
                updateDroneStatus();
            } else {
                // Check if regular user (for demo, we'll allow any username/password)
                currentUser = { username, role: 'employee' };
                isAdmin = false;
                authMessage.textContent = 'Login successful!';
                authMessage.style.color = 'green';
                showDroneStatus();
                updateDroneStatus();
            }
        }

        // Show drone status section
        function showDroneStatus() {
            droneStatusContainer.style.display = 'block';
            adminSection.style.display = 'none';
            logoutSection.style.display = 'block';
            document.querySelector('.login-form').style.display = 'none';
        }

        // Show admin section
        function showAdminSection() {
            droneStatusContainer.style.display = 'block';
            adminSection.classList.add('show');
            logoutSection.style.display = 'block';
            document.querySelector('.login-form').style.display = 'none';
        }

        // Update drone status display
        function updateDroneStatus() {
            droneList.innerHTML = '';
            drones.forEach(drone => {
                const droneCard = document.createElement('div');
                droneCard.className = 'drone-card';
                droneCard.innerHTML = `
                    <h3>${drone.name} (${drone.model})</h3>
                    <div class="drone-status">
                        <span>Status: ${drone.status}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="drone-controls">
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="simulateTakeoff(${drone.id})">Takeoff</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="simulateLanding(${drone.id})">Landing</button>
                    </div>
                `;
                droneList.appendChild(droneCard);
            });
        }

        // Simulate takeoff
        function simulateTakeoff(droneId) {
            const drone = drones.find(d => d.id === droneId);
            if (drone) {
                drone.status = 'in-flight';
                drone.lastUpdate = new Date().toISOString();
                updateDroneStatus();
                alert(`Drone ${drone.name} is now in flight!`);
            }
        }

        // Simulate landing
        function simulateLanding(droneId) {
            const drone = drones.find(d => d.id === droneId);
            if (drone) {
                drone.status = 'landing';
                drone.lastUpdate = new Date().toISOString();
                updateDroneStatus();
                alert(`Drone ${drone.name} is now landing!`);
            }
        }

        // Handle admin form submission
        function handleAdminFormSubmit(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const droneId = document.getElementById('droneId').value;
            const droneName = document.getElementById('droneName').value;
            const droneModel = document.getElementById('droneModel').value;
            const droneStatus = document.getElementById('droneStatus').value;

            // Validate input
            if (!droneId || !droneName || !droneModel) {
                authMessage.textContent = 'Please fill in all fields!';
                authMessage.style.color = 'red';
                return;
            }

            // Create new drone
            const newDrone = {
                id: parseInt(droneId),
                name: droneName,
                model: droneModel,
                status: droneStatus,
                lastUpdate: new Date().toISOString()
            };

            // Add to drones array
            drones.push(newDrone);

            // Update UI
            updateDroneStatus();
            authMessage.textContent = 'Drone added successfully!';
            authMessage.style.color = 'green';

            // Reset form
            adminForm.reset();
        }

        // Handle logout
        function handleLogout() {
            currentUser = null;
            isAdmin = false;
            authMessage.textContent = 'You have been logged out.';
            authMessage.style.color = 'red';
            droneStatusContainer.style.display = 'none';
            adminSection.style.display = 'none';
            logoutSection.style.display = 'none';
            document.querySelector('.login-form').style.display = 'block';
        }

        // Add event listener for window resize
        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
            // Adjust layout if needed
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

This complete HTML file implements a drone management system with the following features:

1. **Employee Login**: Users can log in to view drone statuses
2. **Drone Status Display**: Shows current status of all drones (in-flight, landing, malfunction)
3. **Control Buttons**: Employees can simulate takeoff and landing for drones
4. **Admin Panel**: Only accessible with admin credentials (uavadmin/321321)
5. **Add New Drone**: Admins can add new drone information with ID, name, model, and initial status
6. **Responsive Design**: Works on different screen sizes
7. **User Feedback**: Shows success/error messages for actions
8. **Logout Functionality**: Users can log out of the system

The system uses simulated data for drones and implements all required functionality as specified in the requirements.

